{"name":"Trumpet Teal","hex":"#5a7d7a","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"trumpet","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A musical instrument of the brass family, generally tuned to the key of B-flat; by extension, any type of lip-vibrated aerophone, most often valveless and not chromatic.","Someone who plays the trumpet; a trumpeter."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To sound loudly, be amplified","To play the trumpet."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/trumpet"},{"term":"teal","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Any of various small freshwater ducks of the genus Anas that are brightly coloured and have short necks.","A dark, somewhat bluish-green colour; a dark cyan."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Having a bluish-green colour."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/teal"}],"entries":[{"title":"Trumpet","blocks":[{"text":"The trumpet is a brass instrument. The most common type of trumpet is a transposing instrument in B♭, with pitches sounding a whole step lower than written. The trumpet family includes instruments ranging from the piccolo trumpet, with the highest register in the brass family, to the bass trumpet, pitched one octave below the standard B♭ or C trumpet."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/12/Yamaha_Trumpet_YTR-8335LA_crop.jpg/330px-Yamaha_Trumpet_YTR-8335LA_crop.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Trumpet","wikidata":"Q8338"},{"title":"Teal","blocks":[{"text":"Teal is a dark cyan color. Its name comes from that of a bird, the Eurasian teal which has a similarly colored stripe on its head. The word is often used colloquially to refer to shades of cyan in general."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1a/Smithsonian_-_NMAAHC_-_Teal_blue_dress_and_cropped_jacket_designed_by_Ann_Lowe-_NMAAHC_2014.73.2.1-.2.jpg/330px-Smithsonian_-_NMAAHC_-_Teal_blue_